          "key": "C",
          "text": "Both DNA and RNA contain ribose sugar."
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "text": "The nucleotides in the polynucleotide chains of both DNA and RNA are joined by condensation."
        }
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "hint": "Review 2.7 Nucleic acids."
